adm.manual.monitor_blocks.overview_title=Monitor Blocks Overview
adm.manual.monitor_blocks.overview_text=TeXTech adds 5 AE2-related blocks: four monitor linkers feed statistics to the Advance Data Monitor display, plus the Matter Ball Decompressor for extracting Avaritia matter clusters.\n\nPlacement: all blocks connect to AE2 via cable adjacency and require AE2 power and a channel (the decompressor also needs a channel).\n\nRight-click linker blocks to see current status in chat. Bind them to a Data Monitor for continuous in-world display.\n\nTips: use a Data Imprint Tool to bind linkers to monitors quickly (sneak+right-click linker, then sneak+right-click monitor).

