adm.manual.monitor_tools.overview_title=Monitor Tools Overview
adm.manual.monitor_tools.overview_text=These tools support and enhance the Data Monitor system. The Data Imprint Tool captures NBT snapshots for binding, the Advanced Storage Link Cell configures storage monitoring filters, and the Advance Link Scanner lets you find and manage all link blocks across your world.\n\nAll three tools work together with the monitor blocks described in the previous chapter.

