adm.webae.phase3.integration_title=Phase 3 Integration Pages
adm.webae.phase3.alerts_title=Automation Alerts
adm.webae.phase3.alerts_text=Configure rules in config/textech/web-alerts.json (auto-created on first access). Server tick engine detects inventory thresholds, stuck CPUs, GT errors, order completions, and channel overload; browser polls GET /api/alerts for Toast and optional Notification API.
adm.webae.pocket.overview_op=Dimensional pocket overview requires OP (read-only stats only; no item contents).
adm.webae.search.title=Global Search (Ctrl+K)
adm.webae.search.text=Press Ctrl+K to open the command palette and search AE storage items/fluids/essentia, NEI recipes, GT machines, and AE patterns, then jump to the matching page. Uses GET /api/search first; falls back to local snapshot filtering when offline.
adm.manual.web_console.search_title=Global Search (Ctrl+K)
adm.manual.web_console.search_text=The Web console command palette (Ctrl+K / Cmd+K) supports cross-page search:\n- Page navigation (all sidebar pages)\n- AE storage items, fluids, essentia (snapshot cache)\n- NEI recipe cache\n- GT machine names/status\n- AE patterns (Grid + Interface)\n\nPrefers the GET /api/search aggregate endpoint (500ms rate limit); falls back to locally loaded storage/GT snapshot filtering when the API is unavailable. Selecting a result navigates to the page and prefills the search box.
adm.manual.web_console.visibility_refresh_title=Background Tabs & Auto-Refresh
adm.manual.web_console.visibility_refresh_text=The Web console can pause automatic polling while the browser tab is in the background (Settings → Data Freshness → "Pause refresh when tab hidden", on by default).\n\nThis covers the TopBar global auto-refresh, connection heartbeat, alert polling, dashboard metrics, chat/player lists, AE order progress, and more. When you return to the tab, data refreshes once immediately; the TopBar countdown shows "Paused" while polling is suspended.
adm.manual.web_console.gt_charts_title=GT Machine Charts
adm.manual.web_console.gt_charts_text=The GT Machines page shows a summary row above the table:\n\n- Status distribution pie chart (running / error / idle).\n- Recipe map bar chart (top recipe maps by machine count).\n\nThe table uses progress bars for each machine; error/problem rows are highlighted. Charts aggregate across all selected networks.
adm.manual.web_console.essentia_title=Essentia page
adm.manual.web_console.essentia_text=The sidebar Essentia page (?page=essentia) shows Thaumcraft essentia (aspect) storage:\n\n- Summary: aspect type count and total amount (merged in multi-network merged mode).\n- Trend chart: essentiaCountHistory from NetworkMetricSampler (aspect type count over time).\n- Table: search by aspect, column sort, pagination.\n\nGlobal search (Ctrl+K) routes essentia hits here with a prefilled search box. Empty state when Thaumcraft is absent or no essentia is stored.
adm.manual.web_console.alerts_edit_title=Automation Alert Rules
adm.manual.web_console.alerts_edit_text=WebAE can watch storage thresholds, stuck CPUs, GT errors, order completions, and channel overload (config/textech/web-alerts.json).\n\nIn Settings → Automation Alerts, in-game OP (level 2+) can edit rules and save from the browser. Non-OP users see read-only rules.\n\nInventory rules need an itemId or fluidName, a minimum amount, and optional network filter (-1 = all networks).
adm.manual.web_console.order_templates_title=Batch Order Templates
adm.manual.web_console.order_templates_text=On the Orders page (Query & Order tab), the batch panel can save and load reusable restock presets.\n\nSave as Template: stores current batch rows, selected crafting CPU, and network ID to config/textech/web-order-templates.json (per WebAE owner UUID).\n\nTemplates: load a preset into the batch form, rename, or delete. Fill Gaps compares template target amounts against AE storage and writes shortage rows only.\n\nAfter loading, submit with Place All (/api/order/batch) as usual. Templates persist across browser refresh and server restart.
adm.manual.web_console.extensions_title=Extended Features (Phase 6–12)
adm.manual.web_console.extensions_text=Recent WebAE extensions:\n\n- **Craft tree (Phase 6)**: Orders page → Craft Tree tab; GET /api/craft/tree expands NEI recipes and compares storage gaps.\n- **SSE alerts (Phase 9)**: GET /api/events/stream pushes alerts in real time (15s heartbeat); useEventStream complements 10s polling.\n- **P2P channel map (Phase 10)**: Topology page → P2P channels view; GET /api/network/p2p groups tunnels by frequency.\n- **Monitor preview (Phase 11)**: Monitor Bindings → Preview per slot; GET /api/monitor/preview returns line-chart values.\n- **PWA & mobile (Phase 12)**: manifest.webmanifest + responsive CSS for narrow screens; add to home screen on phones.\n- **CSV export (Phase 13)**: Storage / GT / Topology pages export tables via client-side Blob download.
adm.manual.web_console.phase3_title=Phase 3 Integration & Alerts
adm.manual.web_console.phase3_text=Phase 3 adds cross-system read-only pages and automation alerts.\n\nIntegration pages (sidebar):\n- Link Scanner mirror: GET /api/scanner/blocks — loaded-chunk link blocks; teleport stays in-game.\n- Monitor bindings: GET /api/monitor/bindings — chart slots and GT machine coords; Preview per slot calls GET /api/monitor/preview for a line chart Drawer.\n- Planner: GET /api/planner/plans — read-only list from config/textech/plans.json.\n- AI Assistant: POST /api/assistant/query — rule-based server queries (2s rate limit; no AI keys on server).\n- Topology cell summary: GET /api/network/cells — infinite cell / byte stats on the topology page.\n- Pocket overview: GET /api/pocket/overview — OP-only minimal stats (no stored items).\n\nAutomation (A1–A5): config/textech/web-alerts.json drives WebAlertEngine; GET /api/alerts returns active alerts; OP can edit rules in Settings; useWebAlerts Toast + browser notifications; useEventStream via GET /api/events/stream SSE (15s heartbeat; pauses when tab hidden).
